            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Never Not Shooting is a 4 player cooperative local multiplayer enemy-hell game inspired by classic arcade style action with a focus on competing for high scores. Join together with up to three other people in this cooperative experience while you try and defend the energy core from an ever mounting wave of enemy forces. Choose between a wide selection of customizable weapons and special abilities as you and your friends create the ultimate team combination for maximum destruction. Be aware that you are fighting a losing battle. For every enemy you kill, 2 more will spawn faster and stronger than before. <br><br>How long will your team be able to survive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>Customizable ships<br></li><li>Procedurally generated waves of enemies<br></li><li>27 weapon combinations<br></li><li>4 player local cooperative play<br></li><li>Enemies that upgrade over time</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Never Not Shooting is a 4 player cooperative local multiplayer enemy-hell game inspired by classic arcade style action with a focus on competing for high scores. Join together with up to three other people in this cooperative experience while you try and defend the energy core from an ever mounting wave of enemy forces. Choose between a wide selection of customizable weapons and special abilities as you and your friends create the ultimate team combination for maximum destruction. Be aware that you are fighting a losing battle. For every enemy you kill, 2 more will spawn faster and stronger than before. <br><br>How long will your team be able to survive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>Customizable ships<br></li><li>Procedurally generated waves of enemies<br></li><li>27 weapon combinations<br></li><li>4 player local cooperative play<br></li><li>Enemies that upgrade over time</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Grab up to 3 friends and defend the sun from swarms of enemies in this local coop twin stick shooter. Siphon energy from the sun and shoot as many attackers as you can to claim the high score before it explodes! Fight over experience and upgrade your ship to keep up with the ever-mounting pressure.",
